        "name": "Burst",
        "intent": "Burst outward, sparks drifting down, then gone.",
        "source": "\non tick\n  self.t = self.t + dt\n  let s = 0.5 + sqrt(self.t) * 5\n  self.scale = (s, s, s)\n  move self by (0, -1.2 * dt, 0)\n  if self.t > 1.6 then\n    destroy self\n  end\nend",
        "enabled": true
